{"seq":2,"slug":"debt-quantification-prioritization","title":"债务量化与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/tech-debt-engineering/debt-quantification-prioritization","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"债务量化与优先级\">债务量化与优先级</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量化技术债务的目的是把&quot;感觉代码很烂&quot;变成可讨论的业务决策：不需要精确到小数点后两位，只需要一个足够好的、能指导排序的框架。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>量化的意义</strong>：能说出&quot;每月多花 40 小时维护&quot;才推动得了资源，模糊感受无法行动。</li>\n<li><strong>利息率</strong>：持有债务的持续成本，按表现分类，是量化的核心锚点。</li>\n<li><strong>延迟成本法</strong>：用&quot;不做这件事的代价&quot;衡量价值，把技术话题转为业务语言。</li>\n<li><strong>WSJF 优先级</strong>：以延迟成本与实现成本的比值排序，优先做高价值低成本的项。</li>\n<li><strong>偿还节奏</strong>：预算中固定一部分用于持续偿还，避免债务长期只增不减。</li>\n<li><strong>向管理层沟通</strong>：用仪表盘与业务指标表达债务，比技术细节更能获得支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文后续的利息分类、量化框架、WSJF 模型、沟通与预算策略，都是这些概念的具体展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要量化\">为什么需要量化</h2><p>&quot;我们有很多技术债务&quot;是一句无法推动行动的话。只有当你能说出&quot;这项技术债务每月让团队多花 40 小时的维护时间&quot;，管理层才会认真对待。量化技术债务的目标不是精确到小数点后两位，而是建立一个足够好的决策框架。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;模糊感受:&lt;br/&gt;代码很烂&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;定性识别:&lt;br/&gt;有 15 项技术债务&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;定量评估:&lt;br/&gt;每月消耗 120 工时&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;优先排序:&lt;br/&gt;前 3 项偿还 ROI 最高&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;行动计划:&lt;br/&gt;本季度偿还这 3 项&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"模糊感受:&lt;br/&gt;代码很烂\"] --&gt; B[\"定性识别:&lt;br/&gt;有 15 项技术债务\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"定量评估:&lt;br/&gt;每月消耗 120 工时\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"优先排序:&lt;br/&gt;前 3 项偿还 ROI 最高\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"行动计划:&lt;br/&gt;本季度偿还这 3 项\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"技术债务的利息隐喻\">技术债务的利息隐喻</h2><p>技术债务最强大的量化工具是&quot;利息&quot;概念——持有债务的持续成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"利息的表现形式\">利息的表现形式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>利息形式</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发减速</td>\n<td>新功能交付时间增加</td>\n<td>原来 1 天的功能现在要 3 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bug 频率</td>\n<td>特定模块的 Bug 数/月</td>\n<td>支付模块每月 5+ 个 Bug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认知负荷</td>\n<td>新成员上手时间</td>\n<td>理解订单模块需要 2 周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更风险</td>\n<td>修改导致回归的概率</td>\n<td>每次改动有 30% 概率引发新 Bug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维成本</td>\n<td>手动操作时间</td>\n<td>每次部署需要 2 小时手动步骤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"利息率分类\">利息率分类</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[技术债务] --&gt; B{利息率?}&#10;    B --&gt;|增长型| C[&quot;每月成本递增\\n例: 未升级框架\\n升级成本随时间增长&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|稳定型| D[&quot;每月成本固定\\n例: 缺少自动化测试\\n手动测试工时稳定&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|递减型| E[&quot;成本自然降低\\n例: 即将废弃的模块\\n使用频率在下降&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[技术债务] --&gt; B{利息率?}\n    B --&gt;|增长型| C[\"每月成本递增\\n例: 未升级框架\\n升级成本随时间增长\"]\n    B --&gt;|稳定型| D[\"每月成本固定\\n例: 缺少自动化测试\\n手动测试工时稳定\"]\n    B --&gt;|递减型| E[\"成本自然降低\\n例: 即将废弃的模块\\n使用频率在下降\"]</pre><p>增长型利息应该优先偿还，因为每延迟一天，总偿还成本都在增加。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"量化框架\">量化框架</h2><h3 id=\"延迟成本法-cost-of-delay\">延迟成本法（Cost of Delay）</h3><p>延迟成本回答一个关键问题：<strong>如果不偿还这项技术债务，每月额外付出多少成本？</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TechDebtCostAnalysis {&#10;  debtItem: string;&#10;  monthlyInterest: {&#10;    extraDevHours: number;&#10;    bugFixHours: number;&#10;    incidentResponseHours: number;&#10;    onboardingDelay: number;&#10;  };&#10;  repaymentCost: {&#10;    estimatedHours: number;&#10;    riskLevel: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  roi: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateROI(analysis: TechDebtCostAnalysis): number {&#10;  const monthlyInterest =&#10;    analysis.monthlyInterest.extraDevHours +&#10;    analysis.monthlyInterest.bugFixHours +&#10;    analysis.monthlyInterest.incidentResponseHours;&#10;&#10;  const annualSaving = monthlyInterest * 12;&#10;  const repaymentCost = analysis.repaymentCost.estimatedHours;&#10;&#10;  return annualSaving / repaymentCost;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TechDebtCostAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  debtItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  monthlyInterest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    extraDevHours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bugFixHours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    incidentResponseHours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    onboardingDelay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  repaymentCost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    estimatedHours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    riskLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  roi</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateROI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">analysis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TechDebtCostAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> monthlyInterest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    analysis.monthlyInterest.extraDevHours </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    analysis.monthlyInterest.bugFixHours </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    analysis.monthlyInterest.incidentResponseHours;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> annualSaving</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monthlyInterest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> repaymentCost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analysis.repaymentCost.estimatedHours;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> annualSaving </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repaymentCost;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实际计算示例\">实际计算示例</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>债务项</th>\n<th>月利息(工时)</th>\n<th>偿还成本(工时)</th>\n<th>年化 ROI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缺少 CI/CD</td>\n<td>40h/月</td>\n<td>80h</td>\n<td>6.0x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遗留 jQuery 代码</td>\n<td>20h/月</td>\n<td>200h</td>\n<td>1.2x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺少类型定义</td>\n<td>15h/月</td>\n<td>60h</td>\n<td>3.0x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库无索引</td>\n<td>5h/月</td>\n<td>8h</td>\n<td>7.5x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单体拆分微服务</td>\n<td>30h/月</td>\n<td>500h</td>\n<td>0.72x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从 ROI 来看，数据库加索引（7.5x）和搭建 CI/CD（6.0x）应该优先处理。单体拆分虽然月利息高，但偿还成本太大，ROI 低于 1，需要更审慎地评估。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"技术债务象限优先级\">技术债务象限优先级</h2><h3 id=\"wsjf-优先级模型\">WSJF 优先级模型</h3><p>Weighted Shortest Job First 结合了价值和成本两个维度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"quadrantChart\" data-source=\"quadrantChart&#10;    title 技术债务优先级矩阵&#10;    x-axis &quot;低偿还成本&quot; --&gt; &quot;高偿还成本&quot;&#10;    y-axis &quot;低利息&quot; --&gt; &quot;高利息&quot;&#10;    quadrant-1 &quot;大石头: 高价值但昂贵&quot;&#10;    quadrant-2 &quot;速赢: 立即行动!&quot;&#10;    quadrant-3 &quot;填充: 有空就做&quot;&#10;    quadrant-4 &quot;陷阱: 谨慎评估&quot;&#10;    &quot;加索引&quot;: [0.15, 0.6]&#10;    CI/CD: [0.35, 0.8]&#10;    &quot;类型定义&quot;: [0.3, 0.55]&#10;    &quot;jQuery迁移&quot;: [0.7, 0.5]&#10;    &quot;微服务拆分&quot;: [0.85, 0.7]\">quadrantChart\n    title 技术债务优先级矩阵\n    x-axis \"低偿还成本\" --&gt; \"高偿还成本\"\n    y-axis \"低利息\" --&gt; \"高利息\"\n    quadrant-1 \"大石头: 高价值但昂贵\"\n    quadrant-2 \"速赢: 立即行动!\"\n    quadrant-3 \"填充: 有空就做\"\n    quadrant-4 \"陷阱: 谨慎评估\"\n    \"加索引\": [0.15, 0.6]\n    CI/CD: [0.35, 0.8]\n    \"类型定义\": [0.3, 0.55]\n    \"jQuery迁移\": [0.7, 0.5]\n    \"微服务拆分\": [0.85, 0.7]</pre><h3 id=\"决策框架\">决策框架</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>速赢 (低成本 + 高利息)</td>\n<td>ROI 极高</td>\n<td>立即安排，本迭代内完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大石头 (高成本 + 高利息)</td>\n<td>需要拆解</td>\n<td>分阶段偿还，每阶段独立可交付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填充 (低成本 + 低利息)</td>\n<td>顺手就做</td>\n<td>穿插在日常开发中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>陷阱 (高成本 + 低利息)</td>\n<td>看起来重要但 ROI 低</td>\n<td>除非利息率在增长，否则暂缓</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"向管理层沟通技术债务\">向管理层沟通技术债务</h2><p>工程师常犯的错误是用技术语言描述技术债务——&quot;我们需要重构订单模块的抽象层&quot;。管理层听不懂也不感兴趣。有效的沟通应该用<strong>业务语言</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术描述</th>\n<th>业务描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;需要升级 React 版本&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;当前版本已不再获得安全更新，存在合规风险&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;代码耦合度太高&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;每个新功能的交付时间比 6 个月前多了 50%&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;缺少自动化测试&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;每次发版需要 3 天手动测试，且仍有 20% 概率出线上 Bug&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;数据库需要重构&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;用户量翻倍后，页面加载将超过 10 秒，预计流失 40% 用户&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"技术债务仪表盘\">技术债务仪表盘</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TechDebtDashboard {&#10;  totalDebtItems: number;&#10;  totalMonthlyInterest: number;&#10;  debtByCategory: Record&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;  topPriorityItems: Array&lt;{&#10;    title: string;&#10;    monthlyInterest: number;&#10;    repaymentCost: number;&#10;    roi: number;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;  trendData: Array&lt;{&#10;    month: string;&#10;    newDebt: number;&#10;    repaidDebt: number;&#10;    netChange: number;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TechDebtDashboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalDebtItems</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalMonthlyInterest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  debtByCategory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  topPriorityItems</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    monthlyInterest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    repaymentCost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    roi</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  trendData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    month</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    newDebt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    repaidDebt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    netChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"xychart\" data-source=\"xychart-beta&#10;    title &quot;技术债务趋势(月度)&quot;&#10;    x-axis [&quot;一月&quot;, &quot;二月&quot;, &quot;三月&quot;, &quot;四月&quot;, &quot;五月&quot;, &quot;六月&quot;]&#10;    y-axis &quot;债务项数量&quot; 0 --&gt; 30&#10;    bar [5, 8, 6, 4, 7, 3]&#10;    line [15, 18, 20, 19, 21, 18]\">xychart-beta\n    title \"技术债务趋势(月度)\"\n    x-axis [\"一月\", \"二月\", \"三月\", \"四月\", \"五月\", \"六月\"]\n    y-axis \"债务项数量\" 0 --&gt; 30\n    bar [5, 8, 6, 4, 7, 3]\n    line [15, 18, 20, 19, 21, 18]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"预算分配策略\">预算分配策略</h2><h3 id=\"黄金比例\">黄金比例</h3><p>业界普遍推荐的技术债务偿还预算比例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>比例</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>20% 规则</td>\n<td>每个迭代 20% 产能用于债务偿还</td>\n<td>债务中等，团队稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boy Scout Rule</td>\n<td>每次提交让代码比之前好一点</td>\n<td>低债务，持续改进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>债务冲刺</td>\n<td>专门安排一个冲刺全力偿还</td>\n<td>高债务，需要集中清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合模式</td>\n<td>日常 10% + 每季度一次债务冲刺</td>\n<td>推荐的平衡方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"偿还节奏\">偿还节奏</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 季度技术债务偿还计划&#10;    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD&#10;    section 持续偿还 (10%)&#10;    日常代码改进      :active, 2024-01-01, 90d&#10;    section 速赢项目&#10;    添加数据库索引     :done, 2024-01-08, 2d&#10;    配置 CI/CD         :done, 2024-01-15, 5d&#10;    section 大石头 (分阶段)&#10;    类型定义 Phase 1   :2024-02-01, 10d&#10;    类型定义 Phase 2   :2024-02-15, 10d&#10;    section 债务冲刺&#10;    Q1 债务清理冲刺    :crit, 2024-03-18, 10d\">gantt\n    title 季度技术债务偿还计划\n    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n    section 持续偿还 (10%)\n    日常代码改进      :active, 2024-01-01, 90d\n    section 速赢项目\n    添加数据库索引     :done, 2024-01-08, 2d\n    配置 CI/CD         :done, 2024-01-15, 5d\n    section 大石头 (分阶段)\n    类型定义 Phase 1   :2024-02-01, 10d\n    类型定义 Phase 2   :2024-02-15, 10d\n    section 债务冲刺\n    Q1 债务清理冲刺    :crit, 2024-03-18, 10d</pre><p>量化技术债务并建立优先级框架，是将&quot;感觉代码很烂&quot;转化为&quot;有数据支撑的改进计划&quot;的关键步骤。当你能用 ROI 和延迟成本来讨论技术债务时，它就从一个纯技术话题变成了一个业务决策——而业务决策才能获得资源和支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量化的价值在于可行动，而非精确；&quot;每月多花 40 小时&quot;这类表述才推动资源。</li>\n<li>利息率是量化的核心锚点，表达持有债务的持续成本。</li>\n<li>延迟成本把技术债务翻译成业务语言，是获得管理层支持的关键。</li>\n<li>WSJF 用延迟成本与实现成本之比排序，指导&quot;先做哪一项&quot;。</li>\n<li>固定偿还预算与节奏，才能让债务停止单向累积。</li>\n<li>债务仪表盘让沟通从技术细节转向业务影响，从而获得持续投入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"债务量化与优先级","id":"债务量化与优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要量化","id":"为什么需要量化"},{"level":2,"text":"技术债务的利息隐喻","id":"技术债务的利息隐喻"},{"level":3,"text":"利息的表现形式","id":"利息的表现形式"},{"level":3,"text":"利息率分类","id":"利息率分类"},{"level":2,"text":"量化框架","id":"量化框架"},{"level":3,"text":"延迟成本法（Cost of Delay）","id":"延迟成本法-cost-of-delay"},{"level":3,"text":"实际计算示例","id":"实际计算示例"},{"level":2,"text":"技术债务象限优先级","id":"技术债务象限优先级"},{"level":3,"text":"WSJF 优先级模型","id":"wsjf-优先级模型"},{"level":3,"text":"决策框架","id":"决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"向管理层沟通技术债务","id":"向管理层沟通技术债务"},{"level":3,"text":"技术债务仪表盘","id":"技术债务仪表盘"},{"level":2,"text":"预算分配策略","id":"预算分配策略"},{"level":3,"text":"黄金比例","id":"黄金比例"},{"level":3,"text":"偿还节奏","id":"偿还节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"识别技术债务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/tech-debt-engineering/identifying-tech-debt"},"next":{"title":"重构策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/tech-debt-engineering/refactoring-strategies"}}